		<letterStack>
			<letters>
				<li Class="StandardLetter">
					<def>BadNonUrgent</def>
					<label>Mental break: sad wander</label>
					<lookTarget>Thing_Human37849</lookTarget>
					<disappearAtTick>-1</disappearAtTick>
					<text>Marina, Geologist is wandering around in sadness.

The final straw was: Tired.</text>
				</li>
				<li Class="StandardLetter">
					<def>BadNonUrgent</def>
					<label>Solar flare</label>
					<disappearAtTick>-1</disappearAtTick>
					<text>A solar flare has begun.

The intense radiation will shut down all electrical devices.

It should pass in about a day.</text>
				</li>
				<li Class="StandardLetter">
					<def>BadNonUrgent</def>
					<label>Breakdown: electric smelter</label>
					<lookTarget>Thing_ElectricSmelter991042</lookTarget>
					<disappearAtTick>-1</disappearAtTick>
					<text>One of your machines (electric smelter) has broken down. It won't work until a colonist with the Construction work type goes and fixes it.</text>
				</li>
				<li Class="StandardLetter">
					<def>BadNonUrgent</def>
					<label>Eclipse</label>
					<disappearAtTick>-1</disappearAtTick>
					<text>One of the moons of this planet has orbited in front of the sun. An eclipse has begun.</text>
				</li>
				<li Class="StandardLetter">
					<def>BadNonUrgent</def>
					<label>Psychic drone</label>
					<disappearAtTick>-1</disappearAtTick>
					<text>Every colonist of the male gender winces in pain!

Some distant engine of hatred is stirring. It is projecting a powerful psychic drone over this entire region, on a frequency that only seems to affect the male gender. For a few days, some people's mood will be quite a bit worse.</text>
				</li>
				<li Class="StandardLetter">
					<def>BadNonUrgent</def>
					<label>Mental break: daze</label>
					<lookTarget>Thing_Human775352</lookTarget>
					<disappearAtTick>-1</disappearAtTick>
					<text>Morgan, Recruiter is wandering around in a psychotic state.

The final straw was: In a little pain.</text>
				</li>
				<li Class="StandardLetter">
					<def>BadNonUrgent</def>
					<label>Mental break: food binge</label>
					<lookTarget>Thing_Human64655</lookTarget>
					<disappearAtTick>-1</disappearAtTick>
					<text>Tadashi, Surgeon is pigging out on food.

The final straw was: Feeling bad.</text>
				</li>
				<li Class="StandardLetter">
					<def>BadNonUrgent</def>
					<label>Breakdown: electric stove</label>
					<lookTarget>Thing_ElectricStove62480</lookTarget>
					<disappearAtTick>-1</disappearAtTick>
					<text>One of your machines (electric stove) has broken down. It won't work until a colonist with the Construction work type goes and fixes it.</text>
				</li>
				<li Class="StandardLetter">
					<def>BadNonUrgent</def>
					<label>Breakdown: steel improvised turret</label>
					<lookTarget>Thing_TurretGun326287</lookTarget>
					<disappearAtTick>-1</disappearAtTick>
					<text>One of your machines (steel improvised turret) has broken down. It won't work until a colonist with the Construction work type goes and fixes it.</text>
				</li>
				<li Class="StandardLetter">
					<def>BadNonUrgent</def>
